A||||9||KissMySSFiero||4.9 cadi motor...||||5||
Z||000000||KissMySSFiero||11-25-2000||11:11 PM||||has anyone here seen a 4.9 cadi swap.  what kind of mounts are needed.  what kind of flywheel is needed.  i found one site with some info but they had a custom flywheel made.  i used to work at a cadi dealership and i know this is a bad engine.  only majob problems was the intake leaks.  <BR>TIA<BR>JOEJOE||||reg||5
Z||000001||Will||11-25-2000||11:21 PM||||What I have heard is here:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.azstarnet.com/~gduncan/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.azstarnet.com/~gduncan/</A> <P>Is this the site you already found?<BR>E-mail them for specifics.<BR>||||reg||1
